	"descriptionMarkdown": "# Fresh Launch – Tileable Wagon Silos\n\nCompact, tileable rocket launch site fed directly from cargo wagons, built for spoilable items.\n\n## Overview\n\nSpoilable cargo loses freshness every second it sits in a chest or on a belt. This design skips the buffer: items go straight from the cargo wagon into the rocket silo, so they reach your space platform as fresh as possible.\n\nDesigned for:\n\n- Agricultural science pack\n- Bioflux\n- Any other spoilable item (the blueprint is parametrised)\n\n## Features\n\n- **Wagon-fed**: silos are loaded directly from cargo wagons, with no intermediate storage.\n- **Tileable**: stack the blueprint to add as many silos as you need.\n- **Compact**: beacons are shared between silos.\n- **Parametrised**: choose the item to launch when placing the blueprint.\n\n## What's in the book\n\n| Silos | Normal | Legendary |\n|-------|--------|-----------|\n| 4     | ✅     | ✅        |\n| 8     | ✅     | ✅        |\n| 16    | ✅     | ✅        |\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Factorio 2.0 with the Space Age expansion\n- Quality mod (bundled with Space Age) for the legendary versions\n\n## ⚠️ Warning\n\nRockets only lift off once they are full. Set your space platform's **inactivity timeout** to match your inserter speed, otherwise the platform may leave before the rockets launch.\n\nSlower inserters (lower quality, no stack bonus) need a longer timeout.",
